      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "dc χT at 280 K is 58.1 cm3 mol−1 K (calc. 60.0), decreasing to 35.4 cm3 mol−1 K at 2 K, consistent with weak antiferromagnetic 3d–4f interactions plus Ln mJ depopulation. Magnetization at 2–6 K up to 7 T does not saturate. No out-of-phase ac signals (0 or 2000 Oe dc), so no SMM behavior.",
